"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsHomomorphism</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mem_ker</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">G</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsHomomorphism</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">kernel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">↔</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- our `kernel` function returns the bare set; `ker` returns the Subgroup structure</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsHomomorphism</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ker</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">IsHomomorphism</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Subgroup</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">G</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">carrier</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">kernel</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">mul_mem'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ha</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hb</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mem_ker</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ha</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mem_ker</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hb</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mem_ker</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ha</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hb</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mul_one</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">one_mem'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mem_ker</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hom_id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hf</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">inv_mem'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mem_ker</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mem_ker</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hom_inv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hf</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mul_right_cancel_iff</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">inv_mul_cancel</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">one_mul</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hx</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>On line 26, <code>lemma IsHomomorphism.mem_ker</code> is declared. It is then used several times from lines 34-43, taking advantage of generalized field notation. Positioning the cursor in the declaration of the lemma's name correctly highlights <code>mem_ker</code> in all of those <code>hf.mem_ker</code> uses.</p>\n<p>However, if I invoke the \"Rename Symbol\" functionality (by right-clicking on the name, or hitting F2 while it's highlighted), and rename the lemma to <code>IsHomomorphism.mem_kernel</code>, all of those uses are mutated to <code>hs.IsHomomorphism.mem_kernel</code>, which introduces a bug on each line. There appears to be a mismatch between the correct recognition of <code>hf.mem_ker</code> as an invocation of <code>IsHomomorphism.mem_ker</code> and the incorrect renaming of the short form <code>mem_ker</code> to the long form <code>IsHomomorphism.mem_kernel</code>.</p>\n<p>The same thing happens in the other direction. If I focus <code>mem_ker</code> on line 35 and attempt to Rename it to <code>mem_kernel</code>, the invocations all (correctly) mutate to <code>hf.mem_kernel</code>, but the lemma declaration (incorrectly) mutates to <code>lemma mem_kernel ...</code>.</p>\n<p>As an almost-certainly-related observation, when Renaming one of the generalized field notation invocations, the original name of the variable is presented as <code>mem_ker</code>; when Renaming the lemma declaration, the original name is presented as <code>IsHomomorphism.mem_ker</code>.</p>",
